{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "VF7D4BNT5JAU3ECDCXY25XNQSVIS3JUE",
    "type": "home",
    "storyId": "00000030000022",
    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "サトノダイヤモンド",
            "enName": "Satono Diamond",
            "jpText": "あのー、アヤベさん。今度、天体観測に\n付き添っていただけませんか？",
            "enText": "Um, Ayabe? Could we ask you to come along\non our upcoming stargazing session?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -5694060200807539702,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キタサンブラック",
            "enName": "Kitasan Black",
            "jpText": "授業でやる自由研究、『星を掴む』って\nテーマで、星の観測をすることにしたんです！",
            "enText": "For our independent research assignment,\nwe made our theme \"reach for the stars\"\nand decided to try some amateur astronomy!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3612610871123596397,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "……私より、適任者はいると思うけど。",
            "enText": "…Surely you can find someone\nmore suitable than me.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 8556083228562590077,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キタサンブラック",
            "enName": "Kitasan Black",
            "jpText": "『アヤベさん、学園イチ詳しいよ☆』……と、\nカレンさんの太鼓判、いただいてきました！",
            "enText": "Well, Curren told us, \"Ayabe knows more\nabout stars than anyone else at this school!\"\nSo obviously you're the real deal!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 4109176724226956314,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "また、あの子は……。\nそもそも、急に頼まれても無理だから。",
            "enText": "I wish she would stop that…\nLook, it's just such short notice.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -2592306579422294906,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キタサンブラック",
            "enName": "Kitasan Black",
            "jpText": "あ――……ごめんなさいっ！　です、よね。\n楽しそうだなって、つい……都合も考えず。",
            "enText": "Oh… I'm sorry! We're so inconsiderate…\nAll we could think about was how fun it'd be.\nOf course you can't…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -3121310404288460272,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "…………っ。",
            "enText": "……",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -3477343490486155166,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "……予定を合わせなきゃ、\n無理ってだけ…………。",
            "enText": "I meant… I need to hurry and plan.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -1942104233871883489,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キタサン&サトノ",
            "enName": "Kitasan and Satono",
            "jpText": "それって――！",
            "enText": "Does that mean…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 3438177537769035213,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "その代わり、文句は聞かない。\nあと、大騒ぎもしないで……。",
            "enText": "But I don't want to hear any complaining.\nAnd don't make a racket out there.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -4147192436616792807,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キタサンブラック",
            "enName": "Kitasan Black",
            "jpText": "えへへ……はいっ！\n近隣のご迷惑にならないようにします！",
            "enText": "Hehe, okay! We'll make sure not to bother\nthe neighborhood!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -1495143122876254496,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤベガ",
            "enName": "Admire Vega",
            "jpText": "…………そう。\n観測に最適な日、わかったら伝えるから。",
            "enText": "…Good. I'll let you know when I figure out\nwhat day's clear enough for it.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 4964862783232663252,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780178192,
    "humanTl": true
}